From: Package maintainers <packages@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] pulse: follow layered system configuration paths
Source: https://freedesktop.org/software/pulseaudio/releases/pulseaudio-17.0.tar.xz
Upstream: Not submitted; this is a generic UAPI configuration proposal.

Keep explicit environment paths and per-user files ahead of system policy.
Select each complete system file from the administrator, transient, and
vendor trees. Merge client.conf.d and daemon.conf.d by basename across those
trees and the user tree, with higher trees shadowing lower entries before
the selected files are parsed in lexical order.

Install the four package defaults in the vendor tree. Keep startup scripts
as complete files and preserve their explicit .include behavior.
---
